* ..+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
TITLE
Paper 1 Benchmark FLUKA - S7 @ 500 keV, th=0.8 cm
*
DEFAULTS                                                              PRECISIO  
LOW-PWXS        -1.0                                                            
*
* Nguon photon 500 keV (5.000000E-04 GeV) huong doc truc +z
* GOAT 2026-10-30: BEAM WHAT(3)=10000 mrad (>2000pi) -> nguon diem dang huong
BEAM      -5.000E-04              10000.                              PHOTON
BEAMPOS          0.0       0.0       0.0                                        
*
GEOBEGIN                                                              COMBNAME  
    0    0          Geometry for Paper 1 (MCNPX Benchmark equivalent)
SPH BLK        0.0 0.0 40.0 120.0
SPH WORLD      0.0 0.0 40.0 100.0
RCC COLLOUT    0.0 0.0 10.0 0.0 0.0 35.0 3.0
RCC COLLIN     0.0 0.0 10.0 0.0 0.0 35.0 2.0
RCC SAMPLE     0.0 0.0 50.0 0.0 0.0 0.8000 5.0
RCC DETECT     0.0 0.0 70.0 0.0 0.0 2.0 10.0
RCC SHIELDO    0.0 0.0 45.0 0.0 0.0 30.0 15.0
RCC CAP        0.0 0.0 75.0 0.0 0.0 2.0 15.0
RCC SHIELDI    0.0 0.0 45.0 0.0 0.0 30.0 13.0
END
* Regions
BLKHOLE      5 +BLK -WORLD
COLLBODY     5 +COLLOUT -COLLIN
COLLBORE     5 +COLLIN
SAMPLE       5 +SAMPLE
DETECT       5 +DETECT
SHIELD       5 +SHIELDO -SHIELDI
CAP          5 +CAP
CHAMBER      5 +SHIELDI -COLLOUT -SAMPLE -DETECT
AIRVOID      5 +WORLD -SHIELDO -COLLOUT -CAP
END
GEOEND
*
* Dinh nghia nguyen to vat lieu
MATERIAL           3  -6.94100   0.53400                              LITHIUM   
MATERIAL           5 -10.81100   2.34000                              BORON     
MATERIAL          20 -40.07800   1.55000                              CALCIUM   
MATERIAL          64-157.25000   7.90000                              GADOLINI  
*
* Glass sample S7 (rho = 4.1810 g/cm3)
MATERIAL                         4.18100                              GL_S7     
COMPOUND    -0.15529     BORON  -0.46622    OXYGEN  -0.04674   SILICONGL_S7     
COMPOUND    -0.07147   CALCIUM  -0.26028  GADOLINI                    GL_S7     
*
* Gan vat lieu cho cac vung hinh hoc
ASSIGNMA    BLCKHOLE   BLKHOLE                                                  
ASSIGNMA        LEAD  COLLBODY                                                  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM  COLLBORE                                                  
ASSIGNMA       GL_S7    SAMPLE                                                  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM    DETECT                                                  
ASSIGNMA        LEAD    SHIELD
ASSIGNMA        LEAD       CAP                                                  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   CHAMBER                                                  
ASSIGNMA      VACUUM   AIRVOID                                                  
*
* Ha nguong van chuyen xuong 1 keV
EMFCUT    -1.000E-04 1.000E-06 1.000E-05    VACUUM  @LASTMAT          PROD-CUT  
EMFCUT    -1.000E-04 1.000E-06             BLKHOLE  @LASTREG                    
*
* Scoring: USRTRACK (F4 equivalent track-length fluence)
USRTRACK           1    PHOTON        21    DETECT 628.31853         1TotFlux   
USRTRACK   5.250E-04       0.0                                        &         
USRTRACK           1    PHOTON        22    DETECT 628.31853         1PeakFlux  
USRTRACK   5.050E-04 4.950E-04                                        &         
*
RANDOMIZ           1                                                            
START      @PRIMARIES@.                                                           
STOP                                                                            
